{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub031_bigman_01",
      "hash": "690f43ce056a08a6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呼啊～曬太陽\\n曬著曬著居然就這樣睡著了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub031_bigman_02",
      "hash": "690f42ce056a06f3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……我做了個奇怪的夢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub031_bigman_03",
      "hash": "690f41ce056a0540",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我夢到一個迷失的靈魂\\n化身成火焰到處徘徊！\\c\\n……哦？我手裡什麼時候\\n多了一個招式學習器啊？"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub031_bigman_04",
      "hash": "690f48ce056a1125",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嗯……\\n真讓人不舒服！\\r\\n這個就給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub031_bigman_05",
      "hash": "690f47ce056a0f72",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "招式學習器11是「鬼火」喔……\\n咻～咚隆咚隆～"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_bigman1_01_p01_field_t002",
      "hash": "0d8abe8d759c5238",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 5]"
